    {
      "label": "Materials",
      "value": "Brass, gunmetal, copper, high tensile steel"
    },
    {
      "label": "Rod sizes",
      "value": "9.5 to 25 mm"
    },
    {
      "label": "Tape sizes",
      "value": "20 x 3 to 50 x 6 mm"
    },
    {
      "label": "Catalogue",
      "value": "Earthing and lightning, pages 48 to 52"
    }
  ],
  "intro": [
    "Everything that goes with an earth rod: driving bolts, spikes and heads that protect the rod, couplers to join rods, air terminals and rods for lightning protection, saddles and brackets, tape clips, and a full range of clamps for rod to cable, rod to tape, cable to cable and tower earthing.",
    "Item codes, sizes and materials are listed below as printed in the catalogue; other sizes are available on request."
  ],
  "features": [
    "Driving bolt, spike and head to protect rods and threads",
    "Threaded couplers in gunmetal, brass and aluminium bronze",
    "Air terminals (multiple point), air terminal base and taper pointed air rods",
    "Saddles, rod brackets, tape clips and one hole clips",
    "Clamps for rod to cable, rod to tape, cable to cable and rebar",
    "Tower earth clamps, single and double plate"
  ],
